# Michael Arnaldi

Michael traces Effect to a TypeScript team's needs for dependency injection, reliable tests, resource safety, concurrency control, and retries. [Effect Days 2024, 08:40](https://youtu.be/7sJc3Z4mh1w?t=520).

He describes Effect computations through their outputs, predictable failures, and requirements. [Happy Path 81, 49:15](https://youtu.be/gc5P36t6kD0?t=2955).
